# Source: https://genome.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/help/bedgraph.html
# Symptom: bedGraph format requires non-overlapping intervals on the same
#   chromosome.  This file has overlapping intervals on chr1 (line 2 starts
#   at 200 while line 1 ends at 400); bedGraphToBigWig rejects with:
#   "Overlap/out of order at chr1:100-400 and chr1:200-600"
#   Arises from bamCoverage/deeptools when --binSize is smaller than the
#   average fragment length and fragments aren't properly de-duplicated.
chr1	100	400	0.5
chr1	200	600	0.8
chr1	700	1000	0.3
chr2	0	100	1.0
